<dialog class="refund-dialog" id="refund-review" aria-labelledby="refund-review-title"><h2 id="refund-review-title">Confirm refund details</h2><div data-refund-review-content></div><p class="text-muted">Confirmed payouts post matching credit notes. Pending cheques do not count as money returned. The customer's existing order balance stays unchanged.</p><div class="alert alert-danger" data-dialog-error hidden role="alert"></div><label class="d-block my-3"><input type="checkbox" data-refund-confirm> I have checked the order, amount, method and supporting details.</label><div class="receipt-toolbar"><button class="btn btn-outline-primary" type="button" data-refund-back>Back to edit</button><button class="btn btn-primary" type="button" data-refund-save disabled>Confirm &amp; Record Refund</button></div></dialog>
